  "docTitle": "Device Sync and Backup - SDE Prep Dojo",
  "description": "Design Amazon's device-team family of questions: move settings from an old device to a new one in minutes, keep up to 10 devices of one user in the same state in near real time, and run scheduled backup and restore of settings, files and media with chunking, dedup, integrity checks and multi-region replication.",
  "hero": {
