    "attrs": {
      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip accent\">HLD design</span>\n          <span class=\"chip kafka\">Kafka</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Amazon</span><span class=\"chip company\">Apple</span><span class=\"chip company\">Nutanix</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Device Settings Sync &amp; Backup/Restore (Alexa)</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Three questions Amazon's device teams keep asking, plus Apple's and Nutanix's backup variants: set up a new device from an old one in a few minutes, keep all of a user's devices showing the same state, and back up and restore settings, files and media without losing a byte. One page, one toolkit: versions, push, chunks and hashes.</p>\n      "
